{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOTextArea"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents12MISOTextAreaV","symbolKind":"struct","title":"MISOTextArea","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOTextArea"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOTextArea"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Layout","anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text area is based on several configurable UI elements:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"label"}]},{"type":"text","text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the text area."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some UI contexts, especially when space is limited or when the text area is part of a compact layout, the label can be hidden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, hiding the label should only be done if the purpose remains clear thanks to a placeholder or contextual icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the label is still accessible to screen readers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Hiding a label is a design choice that must balance visual simplicity and clarity of intent, without compromising inclusiveness or form guidance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"placeholder"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the text of the text area is empty a placeholder provides a hint or guidance inside the field to suggest expected input."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Status","anchor":"Status","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Five status are proposed for all layouts:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"enabled (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Default neutral appearance, whether empty or filled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It allows users to click, focus, and type freely without restrictions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"error"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"code":"error","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" status indicates that the user input does not meet validation rules or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expected formatting. It provides immediate visual feedback, typically through a red border,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an error icon, and a clear, accessible error message positioned below the text area. The error message replaces the helper text."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"code":"loading","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" state indicates that the system is processing or retrieving data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"related to the text entered. A progress indicator appears to inform the user that an action is in progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The field remains editable while loading."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"readOnly"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"code":"readOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" status lets the text visible but not editable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}]},{"type":"text","text":": In "},{"code":"disabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" status, the field is non-interactive and grayed out to indicate it cannot be changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Note the SwiftUI "},{"code":"View.disabled()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text (plain)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A supporting text conveys additional information about the text area,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as how it will be used. It should ideally only take up a single line, though may wrap"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to multiple lines if required, and be either persistently visible or visible only on focus."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text (characters max count)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Uses an internal message displaying the count of remaining characters depending to the given value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a specific iOS library feature with 1.4.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper link"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the helper text is not sufficient, it’s possible to offer the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an additional help link (the link can be external or open a modal)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By default no haptics are done by the component.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However you should think about cases where you will have to make the devices vibrate.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can refer to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Mandatory field indication","anchor":"Mandatory-field-indication","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields are mandatory” at the top of your form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Do not use an asterisk at the end of each field label, nor the word “mandatory.”","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If not all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields marked with an * are mandatory” at the top of your form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use an asterisk (*) at the end of each mandatory field label, and ensures this is well vocalized.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"UI rendering of the asterisk must be done with ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"bold font weight","type":"text"}]},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"negative content color","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (red on light backgrounds).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the mention “(optional)” at the end of each optional field label. Note that this rule is not systematic, it remains an option, to be used if needed.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If there is only one field in the form, or if the mandatory nature is obvious,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no mention is necessary since the fields are essential to the form’s functionality.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Outlined style","anchor":"Outlined-style","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"text":", the text area uses a subtle background fill and a bottom border only, creating a softer and more contained look.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"outlined","type":"text"}]},{"text":", the text area uses a transparent background and a visible stroke on all four sides.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This style may be appropriate for contexts where inputs need to feel lightweight and unobtrusive,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for example inside a card, a dialog, or a filtering panel.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    \/\/ An outlined text area","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Fixed height","anchor":"Fixed-height","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"text":", the text area grows vertically as the user types, up to a maximum height defined by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"design system (token ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeMaxHeightInput"},{"text":"). Once that height is reached, the content becomes scrollable.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constrainedMaxHeight"},{"text":" is set to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":", the maximum height is capped to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"minimum","type":"text"}]},{"text":" height","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(token ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeMinHeightInput"},{"text":"), keeping the component at a fixed, compact size at all times.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The content is immediately scrollable from the first overflow line.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is useful in dense layouts — forms, filter panels, chat composers — where vertical space is at a premium.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    \/\/ Height is fixed to the minimum (no vertical growth)","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["    \/\/ The text to display and edit","    @State var text: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ Empty text and no placeholder","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text)","","    \/\/ Empty text with placeholder","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\")","","    \/\/ With a plain helper text","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\",","                 helperText: .plain(\"Maximum 500 characters.\"))","","    \/\/ With a maximum character count — the component shows \"X characters remaining\" (bold)","    \/\/ and switches to an error style when exceeded.","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 helperText: .charactersMaxCount(500))","","    \/\/ With helper link","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openUrl","","    let helperLink = MISOTextArea.Helperlink(text: \"Helper Link\") {","       openUrl.callAsFunction(url)","    }","","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Placeholder\", helperLink: helperLink)","","    \/\/ With error status","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, status: .error(message: \"This field can't be empty.\"))","","    \/\/ Outlined style","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)","","    \/\/ Fixed height — no vertical growth","    MISOTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.1 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 1.4.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextarea"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/Helperlink"]},{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/init(label:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/body"]},{"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/HelperText","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/Status"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea\/View-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Text area is a UI element that allows to type, edit, or select longer blocks of textual data, such as comments, messages or descriptions;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by expanding vertically and offering more space to input text."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for multiline text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, descriptions, and validation feedback."}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextArea":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"MISOTextArea","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOTextArea","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Text area is a UI element that allows to type, edit, or select longer blocks of textual data, such as comments, messages or descriptions;"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"by expanding vertically and offering more space to input text."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for multiline text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, descriptions, and validation feedback.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextarea","title":"MISOTextArea","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextArea","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","title":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOTextArea/View-Implementations":{"role":"collectionGroup","url":"\/documentation\/m